<p>Attack up to three adjacent targets for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage.  If any attack hits you'll create a temporal shear dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> temporal damage in a radius <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> cone.</p><p>Each target you hit with your weapons beyond the first increases the damage of the shear by 25%.  Targets reduced below 20% of maximum life by the shear may be instantly slain.</p><p>The cone damage improves with your Spellpower.</p>